<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer, market quietly steady.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer, market quietly steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $325.40 vs $324.10 previously. Fairly quiet, steady so far ahead of Tuesday's OTC option expiry. Producer selling likely to cap market.</p>
<p>SILVER - Four cents firmer at $4.35/$4.37.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off early high at $324.50/$327.50, $2.00 ahead. Tight, countinuing doubts about Russian exports.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up after surge in Tokyo. $202.00/$205.00.</p>
</text>
